        "message": "A2-DYN v35: expand the action proof and establish a noncircular compact-family local law\n\nRespond to the frozen v34 top-four report. Specify the three anisotropic norms, exact Jacobian and length sums, matched action weights, and the physical representation of peripheral vectors. Prove rotation-free phase rigidity by including the constant collision step in a Z^3 cocycle and using mixing on finite lattice covers. Derive a compact-family microscopic stationary local principle and verify the full oriented-ellipse family with semiaxes in [0.45,0.47].\n\nKeep the title and original raw four-coordinate return problem. Retain every inherited core module, all 967 mathematical labels, all 79 inherited diagnostic scripts and the compiled A--X synopsis. Explicitly repair the varying-test Portmanteau hypothesis; archive its old source, the former main source and bibliography. Add a theorem-level prior-art comparison, a direct Part I proof route, an R1--R8 response and a specialist audit map. The original pointwise return correction and full return complement remain distinguished from the physical theorem.\n\nQualify the exact ordinary source tree, explicit edits, finite arithmetic and native typesetting with a read-only two-branch workflow. Independent human verification and a full raw-return certificate are not asserted.",
